    "title": "THE IMPACT OF INTRADAY MOMENTUM ON STOCK RETURNS: EVIDENCE FROM S&P500 AND CSI300",
    "year": 2021,
    "source_url": "https://doi.org/10.15240/tul/001/2021-4-008",
